{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261110%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1400　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1000　36庭　特委法官孫靖乾<br/>購3200萬口罩受騙 政府向供應商索近億元｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　3庭　裁判官陳志輝<br/>曾被裁盜竊罪成　退休女警再盜逾萬元財物獲判感化｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官彭亮廷<br/>33歲休班警荃灣駕私家車撞貨車　認危駕等3罪｜判刑<br/>3男涉教唆他人虛報學歷履歷申請「高才通」｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>上環找換店10億日圓劫案　9人被控串謀搶劫罪｜再提堂<br/>► 0930　9庭　暫委裁判官秦淑君<br/>大班麵包西餅涉欠薪逾百萬元　董事廖志強否認12罪｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>工程師涉虐兒、襲擊及虐貓被控3罪｜審前覆核<br/>► 1430　15庭　裁判官熊雪如<br/>房署主任認公職人員行為失當　無呈交加戶申請但訛稱房署已批｜判刑</p>\n<p>🔸屯門法院<br/>► 1430　7庭　裁判官覃有方<br/>元朗水蕉新村套丁案｜開審</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.392045+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":527,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:13:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:38:08.315249+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.085732+00:00","content_hash":"6ce6101848168e3374b5935be41eac09cdc483a01dc88df539d0b5d72ffbc5cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}